{"id":"336b1fe36586a678","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-closed-world-assumption.md","title":"Closed World Assumption","display":"df-closed-world-assumption — Closed World Assumption","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-closed-world-assumption","aliases":["57-df-closed-world-assumption"],"display":"df-closed-world-assumption — Closed World Assumption","depends_on":["[[57-df-definite-program]]","[[57-df-logical-consequence]]","[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","[[57-df-herbrand-base]]","[[57-df-herbrand-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-closed-world-assumption"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-closed-world-assumption</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closed-world-assumption — Closed World Assumption"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c234c1cfaaa63dac\" href=\"?note=c234c1cfaaa63dac\" title=\"57-df-definite-program\">57-df-definite-program</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" href=\"?note=d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" title=\"57-df-logical-consequence\">57-df-logical-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ac4f07708b58159c\" href=\"?note=ac4f07708b58159c\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-base\">57-df-herbrand-base</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ff7a0658d8cf65f6\" href=\"?note=ff7a0658d8cf65f6\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-structure\">57-df-herbrand-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c234c1cfaaa63dac\" href=\"?note=c234c1cfaaa63dac\" title=\"57-df-definite-program\">57-df-definite-program</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" href=\"?note=d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" title=\"57-df-logical-consequence\">57-df-logical-consequence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWA}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{CWA}(P)\\)</span> 保留原定义的正原子后承集合，既不改名，也不替换为带负文字的理论。另在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in B_S\">\\(A\\in B_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak H_I(S)\">\\(\\mathfrak H_I(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ac4f07708b58159c\" href=\"?note=ac4f07708b58159c\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-base\">57-df-herbrand-base</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ff7a0658d8cf65f6\" href=\"?note=ff7a0658d8cf65f6\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-structure\">57-df-herbrand-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}\">\\(\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}\\)</span> 为这个集合诱导的基原子真值结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWA}(P)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S:P\\models A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CWA}(P)\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S:P\\models A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\quad A\\notin\\mathrm{CWA}(P)\\leftrightarrow P\\not\\models A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\quad A\\notin\\mathrm{CWA}(P)\\leftrightarrow P\\not\\models A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}\\coloneqq\\mathfrak H_{\\mathrm{CWA}(P)\\cap B_S}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}\\coloneqq\\mathfrak H_{\\mathrm{CWA}(P)\\cap B_S}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in B_S\\quad\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}\\models\\neg A\\leftrightarrow A\\notin\\mathrm{CWA}(P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in B_S\\quad\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}\\models\\neg A\\leftrightarrow A\\notin\\mathrm{CWA}(P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正原子理论的经典后承不会自动包含所有非后承原子的否定；原来的第二个断言混淆了正理论和它诱导的闭世界真值结构。保留 CWA 的集合对象，只把否定判定放到明确指定的结构中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-definite-program","status":"resolved","id":"c234c1cfaaa63dac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-definite-program]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-logical-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"d75d3bc1b6b86e1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-logical-consequence]]","embed":false},{